		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Peut etre est-ce une erreur d&#039;authentification, le dossier pg_hba.conf indique:</p><br /><br /><p># TYPE&#160; DATABASE&#160; &#160; USER&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; CIDR-ADDRESS&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; METHOD</p><p># IPv4 local connections:<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;127.0.0.1/32&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; trust<br /># IPv6 local connections:<br />#host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;trust</p><p>Je suis en mode &quot;trust&quot;, car je ne connaissais pas le mot de passe ... <img src="http://forums.postgresql.fr/img/smilies/smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="smile" /></p>]]></content>
